{"id":"en_my-fiery-empress","title":"My Fiery Empress","titleEn":"My Fiery Empress","description":"Tessa Whitmore is murdered by her husband’s mistress, yet death does not hold her. She returns with powers drawn from Hell, and those around her have no idea what she truly is. With those abilities she settles the score against those who wronged her and even shields the Whitmore family from disaster. Her plans proceed smoothly until the Human Emperor turns his attention toward her, raising the question of what will unfold when the two finally come face to face.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/my-fiery-empress/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/my-fiery-empress/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Ancient","Mystery","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4mw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-fiery-empress_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4mw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-fiery-empress_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4mw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-fiery-empress_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4mw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-fiery-empress_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds4mw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-fiery-empress_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Ru